.SH NAME
CSSScale \- CSSScale
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]Note:\f[R] This feature is available in Web Workers.
.PP
The \f[B]\f[CB]CSSScale\f[B]\f[R] interface of the CSS Typed Object
Model API represents the \f[CR]scale()\f[R] and \f[CR]scale3d()\f[R]
values of the individual \f[CR]transform\f[R] property in CSS.
.SH CONSTRUCTOR
.TP
\f[B]CSSScale()\f[R]
Creates a new \f[CR]CSSScale\f[R] object.
.SH INSTANCE PROPERTIES
\f[I]Also inherits properties from its parent interface,
\f[CI]CSSTransformComponent\f[I].\f[R]
.TP
\f[B]x\f[R]
Returns or sets the x\-axis value.
.TP
\f[B]y\f[R]
Returns or sets the y\-axis value.
.TP
\f[B]z\f[R]
Returns or sets the z\-axis value.
.SH INSTANCE METHODS
\f[I]Also inherits methods from its parent interface,
\f[CI]CSSTransformComponent\f[I].\f[R]
